    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d497">

                <pb facs="0633" n="565" xml:id="pg565"/>

                <head>Count Wydenhruch to Mr. Seward.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington,</hi>
                        </placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1867-04-06"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >April</hi> 6, 1867</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Secretary of State</hi>: In returning you the
                    telegram from New Orleans, I can but renew the expression of my warmest thanks
                    for the extreme kindness and promptness with which you have acted in this
                    affair. The knowledge that your despatch will be sent at once to the proper
                    quarter relieves me from very great anxiety.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to remain, Mr. Secretary, with the highest consideration, your
                    obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WYDENBRUCK.</signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
